/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 38 0 R
/E (For this task, I have created a digital literacy awareness infographic using Canva. I choose Canva because it is easy to use and has many designs and templates. In the infographic, I have explained what digital literacy is, useful digital tools for students, safe internet practices, and professional email etiquette. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
47 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 38 0 R
/E (Ithought digital literacy meant only being able to use digital devices or apps. However, I learned that digital literacy also includes being responsible, safe, and professional online. I learned new things from all five tasks I completed for this project. I learned how to create content, build a profile, and more. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
