50 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 38 0 R
/E (During the process of designing the infographic, I have kept in mind that it should be simple and look attractive so that anyone can easily understand the content. While designing the infographic, the major challenge I faced was to choose the appropriate content without making the infographic look messy. At first, I found it difficult to balance the content and the look of the infographic. However, I have improved the infographic by using short and simple content. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
51 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
