/P 38 0 R
/E (This project was assigned to us to help us realize the importance of digital literacy in our modern world. As a Student Digital Ambassador \(according to the given scenario\), my task was to learn and share digital literacy skills with others. I have successfully completed five different tasks for this project, which include online tools, communication, and cyber safety. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
